 that much Strength; its number is a persistent value.\n  Strength: adds its value to the damage of each attack, can be negative (already reflected in the shown deal N); its number is a persistent value.\n  Thievery: when this enemy's stealing attack lands, it steals that much gold; its number is a persistent value.\n  Vulnerable: the affected creature takes 50% more damage from attacks (already reflected in the shown deal N); its number is turns remaining.\n  Weak: the affected creature deals 25% less attack damage (already reflected in the shown deal N); its number is turns remaining.\n  Reaper: Deal 4 damage to ALL enemies; heal HP equal to unblocked damage dealt. Exhaust.\n  Perfected Strike: Deal 6 damage, plus 2 more for each card with 'Strike' in its name.\n  Discovery: Choose 1 of 3 random cards to add to your hand (costs 0 this turn). Exhaust.\n  Bash: Deal 8 damage. Apply 2 Vulnerable.\n  Body Slam: Deal damage equal to your current Block.\n  Clothesline: Deal 12 damage. Apply 2 Weak.\n  Combust: At end of turn, lose 1 HP and deal 5 damage to all enemies (a Power).\n  Entrench: Double your current Block.\n  Rupture: Power: whenever you lose HP from a card, gain 1 Strength.\n  Shockwave: Apply 3 Weak and 3 Vulnerable to ALL enemies. Exhaust.\n  Shrug It Off: Gain 8 Block. Draw 1 card.\n  Warcry: Draw 1 cards. Put a card from your hand on top of your draw pile. Exhaust.\n  Wild Strike: Deal 12 damage. Shuffle a Wound into your draw pile.\n  Dropkick: Deal 5 damage. If the enemy is Vulnerable, gain 1 energy and draw 1 card.\n  Pandoras Box: On pickup, remove all starter Strike/Defend cards and replace each with a random card.\n  Mercury Hourglass: At the start of combat, deal 3 damage to ALL enemies.\n  Kunai: Every 3rd Attack you play in a turn grants 1 Dexterity.\n  Art Of War: If you play no Attacks during a turn, gain 1 extra energy next turn.\n  Golden Idol: Enemies drop 25% more gold.\n  Philosophers Stone: Gain 1 extra energy each combat; enemies gain 